      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就是因为这样，大家才会追求更精彩的奇迹。\n而我也不想辜负他们的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf0585e46929761769395a8431896284d557e0f899cf33a32e33216b11caa9ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
