        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a68b2580fe351ba596310c7a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅如此，富士奇石经常逗人开心的\n言行举止、奇特的退场方式和戏剧张力的宣言\n也带来帮助，让她的人气急速攀升──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3454d3e0fce6eff8250adb4638fe0da98155df08617f7ea038fbd41ea21cc844",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1005/storytimeline_501005313.json",
      "json_path": [
