      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿嘿……总觉得今天受到你的干劲影响，\n我说什么也不想输呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a80c2420a573a4b22e31914b3577ad67451fbae8c058bec56fe59d471d21b68c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
